            "name": "AFM_analysis.zip",
            "encodingFormat": "application/zip",
            "contentSize": 84668,
            "description": "This folder contains the codes used for analyzing the AFM force mapping data.\n 'A_general_functions', 'A_nanite_functions', 'A_viscofit_functions' and 'SimFit': functions repeatedly used for the analysis;\n 'B_AFM_Analysis': the main file for analysing each individual experiment;\n 'C_calculate_averageCurve': to calculate the average curves per category.",
            "@id": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/R2SLFX",
            "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/R2SLFX",
            "contentUrl": "https://data.goettingen-research-online.de/api/access/datafile/158091"
        },
        {
            "@type": "DataDownload",
            "name": "Cell_shape.zip",
            "encodingFormat": "application/zip",
            "contentSize": 13980,
            "description": "This folder contains the codes used for analyzing the cell shape under stretching. \n 'functions': functions repeatedly used for the analysis;\n '01_Cell_Shape_Analysis': the main file for analysing each individual experiment.",
            "@id": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/IPNOZS",
            "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/IPNOZS",
            "contentUrl": "https://data.goettingen-research-online.de/api/access/datafile/158093"
        },
        {
            "@type": "DataDownload",
            "name": "Cyst_analysis.zip",
            "encodingFormat": "application/zip",
            "contentSize": 5496,
            "description": "This folder contains the code used for analyzing the videos of the cysts under microinjection. The frames of each video have to be manually segmented first.",
            "@id": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/JDQWRC",
            "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/JDQWRC",
            "contentUrl": "https://data.goettingen-research-online.de/api/access/datafile/158092"
        },
        {
            "@type": "DataDownload",
            "name": "Dataset_S1.tab",
            "encodingFormat": "text/tab-separated-values",
            "contentSize": 2911179,
            "description": "This file contains the results from the viscoelastic fitting of the AFM force curves in a csv-format. The following parameters are noted:\n 'curve_index': index of each curve in each force map;\n 'sigma0': pre-stress;\n 'Ka': apparent compressibility modulus;\n 'beta': fluidity;\n 'region': 'rim' or 'inside', division of the cell into the two regions;\n 'image_no': number of the force map per stretching position;\n 'lin_strain': stretching position in x direction in %\n 'experiment_no': numbering of each experimental repetition;\n 'cellline': 'WT' or 'KO';\n 'area_strain': area strain in %.",
            "@id": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/DOI0X0",
            "identifier": "https://doi.org/10.25625/MDCE31/DOI0X0",
            "contentUrl": "https://data.goettingen-research-online.de/api/access/datafile/158094"
        },
        {
